{"title":"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two congruent 30-60-90 are placed so that they overlap partly and their hypotenuses coincide. If the hypotenuse of each triangle is 12, the area common to both triangles is \n</p><p>\t<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/e/0ceefc1dc4021b99241884fac61bf96068145e29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6\\sqrt3\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8\\sqrt3\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 9\\sqrt3\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 12\\sqrt3\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"464\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/6/e563c5943ade4cc11a9747016faa8e1a2496604c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  fill((0,3.464)--(-6,0)--(6,0)--cycle,yellow); draw((-6,0)--(6,0)--(-3,5.196)--(-6,0)); draw((-6,0)--(6,0)--(3,5.196)--(-6,0)); draw((0,3.464)--(0,0)); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(-3,0),S); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(3,0),S);  [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"132\" />\n</p><p>Note that the altitude of the shared region bisects the hypotenuse of the original two right triangles (this can be confirmed by using AAS on the two right triangles with that altitude of the shared region).  By using 30-60-90 triangles, the altitude’s length is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/5/e455d80f4657b1112ba302a6e2c42e9c81f780ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" />.  The area of the shared region is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/824731a7ebdd60c16d5207347d60f0e319d10218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac12 \\cdot 12 \\cdot 2\\sqrt{3} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 12\\sqrt3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"201\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME\" title=\"1973 AHSME\">1973 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1973 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1973\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_